# Blocked personal strings (names, emails, handles) — stored ONLY as salted SHA-256 so this file
# does not itself reveal them. Hash = sha256("penalty-kings/blocklist/v1:" + lowercase token).
# Add one:  node scripts/secret-scan.mjs --hash "some-token"
# A token is a lowercase word [a-z0-9_]+ or an email address. Checked by the pre-commit hook
# (staged files) and by CI (every tracked file, plus all commit messages and author names).
